  "id": "icu",
  "term": "ICU",
  "definition": "In this context, ICU refers to a hospital care setting described as especially intense and complex for nursing work. Working there is associated with higher occupational stress and burnout risk than working in general wards, and these pressures are discussed in relation to imposter feelings among nurses.",
